# Session conduct

- **Do the work in the main session; do not spawn subagents.** The author prefers one agent that
  reads, runs, edits and verifies everything itself, so its context holds the whole picture. This
  covers rewrites, research and audits as well as experiments. If a task looks too large for one
  session, say so and propose how to split it across sessions instead of delegating it.
